  "description": "Ssapcho, the owner of boundless charm that seems to flow in all directions, has made an emergency landing on Naver Webtoon! Shouting, \"Even a hollow laugh is a laugh!\", Ssapcho, a hard-working writer of this era, finds fun even in the harsh and difficult daily life, and embarks on a journey into the life of Ssapcho, who somehow manages to roll on!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
